[maintainability · medium] Dead code: `data_kind_labels_for` has no call site anywhere in the
codebase (only its definition matches; the UI wiring uses `data_kind_context` + the `data_kind_ctx`
template var in `app/web/bags.py`/`bags.html`). Beyond being unused, its logic contradicts the
shipped behavior — for a `NOT_APPLICABLE` bag with `dataset_type="self_built"` and no scene purpose
it returns `["self_built_original"]`, whereas `data_kind_context` intentionally returns `[]` for
